#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:5
#: 26825d0640ae49ff8383dabf329afeb4 53aa2a3fdf654f3e99473e8562a292e3
#: 68b6e99ff7d146ec8bea34486d842aeb 72df3c08adb042c9a510485473e9aa11
#: 7ad798e86a6849409282860f673fd1bf a5479ed243c047a28dbd619416e39b5c
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:7
#: 1ae340f6ae414ff1bb91ed0e7ad25fd7 82df2641750748a39abf4e04ead9c8fc
#: 864a4b5ab7a14152afe8fd8afcd5f852 dc22414954d947fa9fb26708b08242e0
#: f25e2fc2b58b49c1aba3585b3644b635 f7fd0abe97a841e9af107679a8e7d6f7
msgid ""
"FrSky telemetry allows you to display ArduPilot information such as flight "
"modes, battery level, and error messages, as well as information from "
"additional FrSky sensors on `OpenTx <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ compatible"
" RC transmitters and even older X9R transmitters (although with more limited"
" capability)."
msgstr ""
"FrSky 数传让您可以在 `OpenTX <https://www.open-tx.org/>`__ 兼容遥控器乃至旧款 X9R "
"遥控器（功能较有限）上显示 ArduPilot 信息，如飞行模式、电量和错误消息，以及其他 FrSky 传感器的信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:13
#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:9
#: 1352f0f3f1e644499815279a87c7dafd 72d937002dff479eb9336b2d61a65a1c
#: 9eb946f232db46fc876207486f655ff5 cd601e5eb6b741d0aee8f8ae60a31b89
#: cf2d90a2adad47bdb85fa859a6c6b28f f80b1bda634e4f568674ebb3e6eb388d
msgid "It is particularly useful:"
msgstr "它在以下场景中尤为有用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:10
#: 0b745bd2358b4da6a132c99c2a129c57 1804220ebfe24d40b5c1c1f795d294bd
#: 2d36028fb050444e86453bfcb633f1c6 83530790905c49b481da729717b94a1c
#: b25107c7fe2e4546922c61a8ca7ad26f d619c9da8f554c92b54c9bb2ff03e507
msgid ""
"for flying without a ground control station (no need for MAVLink telemetry "
"radio),"
msgstr "无地面控制站飞行（无需 MAVLink 数传电台），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:11
#: 01f15b8f1036427b9bd9360b48da19e0 40e3cd29cdd341e6a71573bb138c8c1a
#: 5367f1cfefc84e01aac235a4601e1bb1 5fd27c95ec86420fa710ba8db93f4118
#: 8a933944bcab4f11aeff3b08775b2dce add9e00ff80b4b1895dac9b4584f35b3
msgid ""
"as a backup in case the ground station fails (e.g., loss of MAVLink radio "
"link),"
msgstr "地面站故障时的备份（如 MAVLink 无线链路丢失），"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:12
#: 1107170a83524fff9ba94eb269c23147 504773a4c48a4644985a5f8e4759c70b
#: 538920ea1c2c427ca4e75850c7c0afdd b8168692b7334c768c93a1227cc4de05
#: d4034323014642039db44dcdb90daf08 e246fd240a814947b829e2f46b830754
msgid "when a separate person operates the ground control station,"
msgstr "由专门的人员操作地面控制站时，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:13
#: 25418e05e8db42d5b81e09b97ad61fe8 36f5ad9200524ff6b868c54376eb7e4d
#: 6676052cb5074307b6a32ce8980af473 bdbfbbcb5e6541159c84ad050fdc0acd
#: bf977c530e9d43e18529645882e5ffe0 c498d8748b8143eb846b309799d1c8b1
msgid "for quick situational awareness by the pilot."
msgstr "飞手快速了解飞行状况。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:15
#: 06e3ff1603ec4b8781788597d88b322a 4ab5a3119f48475f9dc493669b9d6638
#: 8718efc4d7844e8a83009de4820a4065 88bcff63856047f0b3a8e2c6a1a5cc13
#: cbc40faaff824ff48f688b166a4a038a f55ce4cd7506424a845c026b184b8fcc
msgid ""
"Moreover, some RC transmitters such as the Taranis series, Horus, and T16, "
"can be configured to play sounds, vibrate or perform automatic RC actions "
"based on telemetry information through the highly configurable OpenTX "
"firmware."
msgstr ""
"此外，部分遥控器（如 Taranis 系列、Horus 和 T16）可通过高度可配置的 OpenTX "
"固件，根据数传信息播放声音、振动或执行自动遥控操作。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:21
#: 01ca7fc3a59a4cac9d322719eac23e7c 077f15c38ed9420ea226131a53ac35b7
#: 126d4aa7e2fe4aa3a06143745e524981 3bbffe6d19864cddb66b4b1482c2dadc
#: 6a5c08bf8b02471381895bee648a3887 c2c15cdf84fb434eb146ca5d0c3ea3a8
msgid ""
"Common FrSky Telemetry Setup with OpenTX transmitter running "
":ref:`FlightDeck <common-frsky-flightdeck>` or :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry Script "
"<common-frsky-yaapu>`."
msgstr ""
"使用运行 :ref:`FlightDeck <common-frsky-flightdeck>` 或 :ref:`Yaapu Telemetry 脚本 "
"<common-frsky-yaapu>` 的 OpenTX 遥控器的常用 FrSky 数传设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:23
#: 3a8ddcf05dec417c8f2665eafa7f67cc 56d1a5bae2bf4bda8c03a80d25443f45
#: 58c323e93fc843709af63cba918a18fe 60dab9dfb7344a608e14cceec8cab785
#: 6a5e1499c98d496f8d76981d3135c671 93d55cf0448d457696997bae109cf958
msgid ""
"before the addition of FrSky telemetry protocols to ArduPilot, it was "
"necessary to use an external converter to convert normal MAVLink telemetry "
"from the Autopilot into FrSky Sport compatible telemetry (See :ref:`common-"
"frsky-mavlink`), but this is no longer required. However, the `MAV2PT "
"converter <https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3089648-Mavlink-"
"To-FrSky-Passthrough-Converter>`__ is especially useful for converting "
"MAVLink telemetry output from many long-range RC systems for display on an "
"OpenTX transmitter or forwarding via Bluetooth or WiFi to a smarphone or PC "
"running a Ground Control Station."
msgstr ""
"在 ArduPilot 添加 FrSky 数传协议之前，需要使用外置转换器将飞控的普通 MAVLink 数传转换为 FrSky Sport "
"兼容数传（参见 :ref:`common-frsky-mavlink`），但现在已不再需要。然而，`MAV2PT 转换器 "
"<https://www.rcgroups.com/forums/showthread.php?3089648-Mavlink-To-FrSky-"
"Passthrough-Converter>`__ 对于将许多长距离遥控系统的 MAVLink 数传输出转换后在 OpenTX "
"遥控器上显示，或通过蓝牙/WiFi 转发到运行地面控制站的智能手机或 PC 上，仍然特别有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:27
