#: bf6e7c07d4d4461fab38ec84a6e0cb58 c560e3a52314435a8ff4f6750d252080
#: c88705ef6af1478888790239b1d4cfc8 de9c2bd08a2640a0a3058f6a3150ce9f
msgid "In order to use FrSky telemetry, the following steps are required:"
msgstr "使用 FrSky 数传需要以下步骤："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:31
#: 258427110e9642019f70aeef45f2b024 47672933e43841e4960a7b36ea634e88
#: 7faada490ca64af0b2dbe3531ef84d26 a384e73a7fc74428a9df1eeccf7cc666
#: e2330240b5b04b1792b3c2dc87046085 eff8a0e480314dc5b5972e42f6589930
msgid ""
"Connect an autopilot telemetry port to an FrSky receiver which has an SPort "
"or Fport interface. This may require a bi-directional inverter depending on "
"which autopilot it being used. See :ref:`common-connecting-sport-fport`."
msgstr ""
"将飞控数传接口连接到具有 SPort 或 Fport 接口的 FrSky 接收机。根据所使用的飞控，可能需要双向逆变器。参见 :ref:`common-"
"connecting-sport-fport`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:32
#: 6dabbd80c7184677a5b29bb25d75a65d 7bc27244f4144947852fa36b185cb602
#: 8787b3cb2e8047ccb38beaeec54026e7 9611fb4685d441eea02c438628c2461c
#: d6bbf31ca2bf4ad88d9f64c758572739 f3460b76c7ba4f28878a6ba9b89128bb
msgid "Configure the autopilot."
msgstr "配置飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:33
#: 27d62ad30c7e472c8883007586ae5289 558343ac20f64190bfb1f6126735d521
#: 592516407cfb49bb85349bbd4d2b7ef4 c020767f4b7241ccb6e6a6cd344897db
#: cc08d002b895482889f16a0e8ce8073c d50bae0e011142edac1ba7887315354c
msgid ""
"Install a LUA script to display the full telemetry. (Although is it possible"
" to display a subset of telemetry values using OpenTX's built in telemetry "
"screens, it is very limited.)"
msgstr "安装 LUA 脚本以显示完整数传。（虽然可以使用 OpenTX 内置数传屏幕显示部分数传值，但功能非常有限。）"

