#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:51
#: 38f89e3502a6432d98056a3a394c6481 7ae751b60edf4b5f8f1dcdee18e341a7
#: adcf003a858f47cfa35dd4c8e3ea5402 c10801f1bdba43908f57f8059a48813e
#: ed888c3591694dbfb00ac8e2bf05cdcf f3da4719b3dc4b43a63ea9950f7e88ff
msgid ""
"Two protocols are available, Repurposed and PassThrough. Repurposed has been"
" superseded by PassThrough since much more telemetry information can be "
"transferred and displayed."
msgstr "提供两种协议：复用和直通。由于直通协议可以传输和显示更多数传信息，它已经取代了复用协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:53
#: 0ae22a1615be4f648819218fee82daa4 18653ec3b08d4949b6ca796c48379d38
#: 7464897c169c4f25a08c8a1bc127466b 8db3296153404862a22e5f1e321e63ea
