msgid "First set the SERIALxPROTOCOL to \"10\" for the telemetry port used."
msgstr "首先将所用数传接口的 SERIALxPROTOCOL 设置为「10」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:55
#: 03462cb822c743128fa3c7dc5a1b3d5a 27c404341c8149db8bd27598df82cb57
#: 34a5239fd63e4fcb8cad5446d5c693de af2d72e2ad914888b2d1568427537e71
#: b094a69fd4b74a42946b76e726d74827 f8ff1b4796d04d81866b96fcc9f49697
msgid ""
"SERIAL port numbers do not necessarily directly correspond to UART or TELEM "
"port labels. See the hardware documentation for your :ref:`autopilot "
"<common-autopilots>`."
msgstr ""
"SERIAL 接口编号不一定直接对应 UART 或 TELEM 接口标签。请参阅您的 :ref:`飞控 <common-autopilots>` "
"硬件文档。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:57
#: 4690e26b4ffe46f09357c796412081ff 89cc892eb3d14e969d08eadcf41d7367
#: a64a688a268641af86780ddf832c09d3 acfd4a31a8d240c9955d53363c29ecf7
#: b6362e1c4fb44353b2bf695bb191ca46 fb61b60aa75c4fcab86925a34c4549db
msgid ""
"If you have an F7 or H7 autopilot, and therefore do not need to use an "
"external inverter, you must turn on the inverters for the SERIAL port and "
"also set it to half duplex."
msgstr "如果使用 F7 或 H7 飞控，因此不需要外置逆变器，则必须开启 SERIAL 接口的逆变器并将其设置为半双工。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:59
#: 3a7a858ef7964badbd390f786fd84fd4 3e98cababef2488f8707ddf5616e0a09
#: 71d8b95df38e49d68580b9261748c163 793b2e8b41d342abb670087c11c0885f
#: ccf0efbbcc214adaba96d403f0504f58 fbbb82aca02e4c1fae46ccea52e358ab
msgid "Any configuration change to a UART requires a re-boot to take effect."
msgstr "对 UART 的任何配置更改都需要重启才能生效。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:62
#: 401b6f983e9b405e9c20568840cc5afd 458d35dfb0024f09b3e9a7de8afcf278
#: 7d4b62d28b7e4405a191b4d89b9e28e9 a71b4d4c088e471688dd3a0499e02e8a
#: f7b37b53b90d47eead02628b0ff76b3e f986a2d3fec441e4b55b927299082380
msgid ""
"In general, F4 based autopilots using an external bi-directional inverter "
"can use any UART with the following configuration:"
msgstr "通常，使用外置双向逆变器的基于 F4 的飞控可以在任意 UART 上使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:64
#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:69
#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:77
