"``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =160 (enable pull-up/pull-downs on TX and RX pins for "
"those external inverter circuits that may require it)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =160（在 TX 和 RX 引脚上启用上拉/下拉，适用于可能需要此功能的外置逆变器电路）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:67
#: 01ac34e05dec455a94c982b771e0c85f 06a1dd3f296b40f19febccf1190a38d4
#: 1440a6cc7a1f49519bed5e84ed2a064f 2dde3a7538d6494aa4300c04e9a4f4c1
#: 563a265fc90f4342bb9670fee764f3ba 6e4336780efc4615abb19403b3751f5c
msgid ""
"F4 based autopilots using an \"inverted SPort\" output from the receiver can"
" connect it to any  UART's TX pin with the configuration:"
msgstr "使用接收机「反相 SPort」输出的基于 F4 的飞控可将其连接到任意 UART 的 TX 引脚，配置如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:70
#: 1a3ffd0c2de449268c525644b6e3fd99 46352a20a0d34e8095bd0709a165c3e9
#: 614968a2729f49f1ba09e47add12c579 779d9cd6614e4dccaabff3968dddd652
#: f9df5fbb45a24de189b7bab90a5c3531 ff19898cb3974b2ab70cb97b3c86cc02
