msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` = 4（半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:72
#: 0b5e9786075548298238ffa1d3ea2b8a 25605023a3744bdf8b1888d2adf26119
#: 56151dca25544bd7a07c7f3df42fae18 a2de60a5826f40dea39cfb79fe8b1ce6
#: aa19ea4bd1d24f99a11bf3b58d6c9fe3 ea878ff7a175492dbe92e2d365c9ef69
msgid ""
"F4 based autopilots cannot use the RX pin with an \"inverted SPort\" output "
"since the SWAP capability is only available in F7/H7 based autopilots."
msgstr "基于 F4 的飞控不能在「反相 SPort」输出时使用 RX 引脚，因为 SWAP 功能仅在基于 F7/H7 的飞控中可用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:75
#: 073626a6beee4f28b69bcc021720a54f 3f28a5ee127542cfbc2317d30c4494db
#: 8cf96f9737e94c3dbdbe72c034f0005b 97da7fe315484b2fbdcb26deca1f8e30
#: fbc7cbea61c643639761a9e4e76db636 fc568f68d6574d9798a1468fc910d5d4
msgid ""
"F7/H7 based autopilots can directly connect to the TX pin of any UART and "
"use this configuration:"
msgstr "基于 F7/H7 的飞控可直接连接到任意 UART 的 TX 引脚，并使用以下配置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:78
#: 2e0684f6c12b40e7b332a01414d74ef6 3ae094b521d34954b8d7421d34a00fdc
#: 8d0cd80e5d404224a037d711ca40221e b9492fe17b074c97bcab3040ec1b6599
#: f7acb7540fa34a1e85efec44a115d322 feec6883b38b43e2a4db402f1cc05b9a
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  7 (invert TX/RX,Half Duplex)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  7（反相 TX/RX，半双工）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:80
#: 2187cecd36124dfc85c7ca5c215a2948 30a9fd82d57647a29c3a78dbdcd15164
#: 3707d4084c1b45b79d06025d8eb7c424 64aa1d8f206e4fd8b6369f6f1b227fd1
#: 81609471f7654b03b7bcd9e7c19d63d1 e9e9245410fa4daa90293178cf7b6084
msgid "OR to the RX pin:"
msgstr "或连接到 RX 引脚："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:83
#: 187d5190e9134d3cb3dc11c22ddb7984 249f1c49984742e69f22e5656b8ccf57
#: 2c40fd6da1464e8099256b9cce68a2d3 4ec6cc94a87b4e9795b474c9d8c716c1
#: 8ef658ecbccf465fb2b724814118e6d7 b201f6b85c434e5183e62a842bdd8f95
msgid "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  15 (invert TX/RX,Half Duplex, SWAP TX/RX pins)"
msgstr "``SERIALx_OPTIONS`` =  15（反相 TX/RX，半双工，交换 TX/RX 引脚）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:86
#: 1b9f135315454f528bc874c8a339c418 2ea407ce628f425b8a596d8849ac269d
#: 4ed2156203a946a5a36a58a37d29adbf 5770b73e34fe451eb5930932acce000a
#: 6abb80867be94949b3e6485b5f11e7d1 c30ecf0b49174affb8ae9e5fb6ac2a97
msgid ""
"Some F7/H7 autopilots have level/shifters on their UARTs that cause a delay "
"in Half Duplex operation, like CubeOrange. If the above configuration does "
"not, try setting :ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` = 8 which will add padding in"
" the protocol to accommodate this. However, using this option when not "
"required will break operation."
msgstr ""
"部分 F7/H7 飞控（如 CubeOrange）的 UART 上有电平转换器，导致半双工操作延迟。如果上述配置无效，可尝试将 "
":ref:`RC_OPTIONS<RC_OPTIONS>` 设置为 8，这将在协议中添加填充以适应此延迟。但如果不需要此选项时使用它，则会导致操作失败。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:88
#: 02c59e14cc284fd59ba639df1835f047 22855c69841e4dafba8b3dd8911a1865
#: 3c0a9c07481147c48f8fc395dddf1d44 3d0fc5549b3c47b3bbca37d0c922153a
#: 488f3577393241148ca9eff3cdeb3166 679f5f4690da484d8bdee19dbadf2b31
msgid ""
"Set :ref:`FRSKY_OPTIONS<FRSKY_OPTIONS>` bit 0 to \"1\" to enable sending "
"alternating airspeed and groundspeed data to the display script. The "
":ref:`Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX <common-frsky-yaapu>` can use "
"this but it may cause other display apps/scripts to alternate the speed "
"value readout."
msgstr ""
"将 :ref:`FRSKY_OPTIONS<FRSKY_OPTIONS>` 第 0 "
"位设置为「1」以启用向显示脚本交替发送空速和地速数据。:ref:`Yaapu FrSky Telemetry Script for OpenTX "
"<common-frsky-yaapu>` 可以使用此功能，但它可能导致其他显示应用/脚本交替显示速度值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:91
#: 1a08c5ac91e64658b16df11d5ed3e173 5290a6f708b54089970809cc18482960
#: 969c390d8a6c41499b96d3c9b01c0226 a320740fc00f4588b6397fbdd5c34bf1
#: e2f1c590d08e4a008859fdeb4bc72cba f386962f3d0548f18dc138d34a456cbb
msgid "Display Scripts"
msgstr "显示脚本"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:93
#: 09e402afb8664d3d977283227509b7a6 1e33abccbd164e13bab07fcb1b81fcf2
#: 3749d385985e4a7c894afad408e58aab 4e3cd7f9423c4755a1d74da85d1c3dcd
#: ac7e5ba201204f939be6e737d8e2440b fb9016a05a994e1aac880ae0dae0518b
msgid "Several options are available:"
msgstr "有多个选项可供选择："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:102
#: 21cc3f2679fe4de788ade7024d10c252 26a149632e1c42f5b9afd75f517ff3d2
#: 3b91fe685212427ca81c01c49cf039f2 87ce3c7ff1164ea3a4ec0743661de95d
#: 883cf4e1390545e2bd6c57b4e6f60e21 a515339a88154fc98a76f240981498f8
msgid "Turnigy 9XR Pro"
msgstr "Turnigy 9XR Pro"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:104
#: 0f52532f32c84691a846a908f47e51e4 23aa9a9c71094df98ad73bfd2ff4f275
#: 242b2aaabf164c299da827c364bd6966 a42577eb7fdc4c319e7e4188cc21429d
#: e2ddbe205b0242d9bc364e6195ba8556 ec1fbce5a9984f6f8be1ab7eb6027f70
msgid ""
"This section describes how to enable FrSky telemetry on the Turnigy 9XR Pro "
"transmitter."
msgstr "本节介绍如何在 Turnigy 9XR Pro 遥控器上启用 FrSky 数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:108
#: 00e48a38c0dd4557a777cd3544e1f81b 56c6abdca7904c0389b86623fe914fba
#: c5d2dee1362340aa90f73e36da6e1f62 c921f8eabe094aceaa25aa6e746b18e6
#: ddcba39068bf42ca9bc414b84a73469e f60cccbdf4a34f858c72aa80939ac3c2
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "要求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:110
#: 1e033ed425d444ffbc0b6dfce465ca4c 4d7bd56e472345c1b5dde63aa2efbb2a
#: 898f449a280c46799c2de55f3d71ee80 a27bc72680de40d88fa195c01814fa58
#: b0d58309d01043d68a6b885f58dd5a3c c19d759fd285418f84e44d6ce4d8b839
msgid ""
"You will need a transmitter module with support for FrSky telemetry, such as"
" the ``FrSky XJT``.  The DJT_ also supports telemetry, but you will need to "
"use an external cable to connect the telemetry data from the module to your "
"transmitter."
msgstr ""
"您需要一个支持 FrSky 数传的发射机模块，例如 ``FrSky XJT``。DJT_ 也支持数传，但需要使用外置线缆将数传数据从模块连接到遥控器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:115
#: 003a074766ae4ecb8488b106ae59d878 1f2ee54d0cd249628aa6d60a87b70108
#: 4c365b458b0243a689bb6ca239d25dfc 6896b240678946e2af51cf9c58ff5440
#: a042b09be33a4569bf9118cbac1ed2c8 d69acb83e29042a6a7600e1a74743c6d
msgid "The instructions in this section are specifically for the XJT module."
msgstr "本节中的说明专门针对 XJT 模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:118
#: 08c2c72f28da42c286de5769f14959e4 15689b000c844b37a49ffb313c833ac5
#: 9b1930c4e36642a79cfa2a7e58fb7397 b36389f60ce347dabf340f2263ea7eef
#: bce3756c256a4d39a83a7e639641045b c2d48fdfd7b04bfb8ed6f87c641ecbec
msgid ""
"You will need to be running a recent version (211 or later) of the ErSky9x "
"firmware.  You can find more information about upgrading the firmware and "
"about ErSky9x in general from `the documentation`_."
msgstr ""
"您需要运行较新版本（211 或更高版本）的 ErSky9x 固件。有关升级固件和 ErSky9x 的更多信息，请参见 `文档 <the "
"documentation>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:128
#: 27e405c6259f494792d7d942fbc2a085 35bb4418c06045de946b1dd168ebfd91
#: 3b71b56a28a646058681fb7cca5d9228 a07851109f484aa1b2c216460afdf883
#: d667ada416df481dacc9ff54c66d1814 f81103b102c14d52b4a89689b3251d3a
msgid "Configuring ArduPilot"
msgstr "配置 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:130
#: 143085c576d64798a40b78fe78576af7 72450fe6a165480aa1a09d2e85f84a1f
#: 8802bcbea0654e349b66ee39be84e8c8 9039eff4e34941ea96d98756d74cb5d1
#: ba834aad3b414e57b6b494f24609e292 e0fb4725b77245e7a1d0ed512a7a5dc4
msgid ""
"Ensure that you have the appropriate ``SERIAL#_PROTOCOL`` parameter set to "
"``10`` (\"passthrough FrSky telemetry\") to select the ArduPilot SPORT "
"protocol.  For example, if you have plugged your SmartPort cable into the "
"serial 4/5 port on your Pixhawk, set ``SERIAL4_PROTOCOL`` to ``10``."
msgstr ""
"确保为所用数传接口设置了适当的 ``SERIAL#_PROTOCOL`` 参数为 ``10`` （「直通 FrSky 数传」）以选择 ArduPilot"
" SPORT 协议。例如，如果将 SmartPort 线缆插入 Pixhawk 的串口 4/5，请将 ``SERIAL4_PROTOCOL`` 设置为 "
"``10``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:136
#: 0ad43e32d35a4aab969e95f51c8d709a 19457931814f4cada87d485ac232a322
#: 26eb0d0ef78a426198c0a2cfaed4d18a 6783d331a3bf4142a05e157cbd0032c6
#: a53f0606658942fcb738b93f069268a8 e4755dbf4cde42c69020a08bd873e8c7
msgid "Reboot your controller after making this change."
msgstr "更改后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:138
#: 46220d44d75544b38a9c0af67e78d39c 6d01ae305b7149ca998c8051c18eabac
#: 7449179e14d34a67b7a1366e731d6693 8faf7054357d40a3bc4e4f2e3f5552a1
#: 9891f00996e94f44b79157b0d880704c 9f07daa8931448528a24897e48b561e4
msgid ""
"ErSky9x will also work with protocol ``4`` (\"repurposed FrSky telemetry\"),"
" but you will not have access to ArduPilot-specific information such as the "
"name of the current flight mode or arming status."
msgstr ""
"ErSky9x 也可以与协议 ``4`` （「复用 FrSky 数传」）配合使用，但您将无法访问 ArduPilot "
"特有的信息，如当前飞行模式名称或解锁状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:144
#: 0024086f6cb34031997c12a5c9ef10c2 8856466089f043298a78f8fcfdee8113
#: a3b20aef29ab4790b857cedade809629 a3d5dcb40f8343a9b7ab06671dcba9b6
#: b0d76d68d61b42049610f8940569f83a ea82cba4aae74c4285e570d25828b4f0
msgid "Configuring the 9XR Pro"
msgstr "配置 9XR Pro"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:146
#: 075076d592a84499be646cc2ed8e8d3f 0d0c3843f7f94830910b26f0b062c7de
#: 6958934d82254c178ac87d1d8fdd34d9 9336e4b63f1a402e8cd477bf6e829f1a
#: 985d0962fa5946759b9a90e67c2b86df e8b3f2a8a7ad441cab707b4e2c70bda2
msgid ""
"Verify that you are running version 211 or later.  Navigate to the ``Radio "
"Setup`` menu and then select ``Version``.  Look at the ``SVN`` field."
msgstr ""
"确认您运行的是 211 或更高版本。导航到 ``Radio Setup`` 菜单，然后选择 ``Version``。查看 ``SVN`` 字段。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:154
#: 0f6dfbbea8784dda99115192b31a6e7e 54ca24a49071429ca6cdcfe64891b8b7
#: 5bd6b422a21a4caf926c8db21436a7bd 71084852f1a2428a8a7f5b2dd5c059e3
#: b86559e14feb4467b1e29afe1022c2ba bfe40b16f4124017ba6682374253df6c
msgid "Telemetry support is substantially improved in revision 218 and later."
msgstr "数传支持在修订版 218 及更高版本中有了实质性改进。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:157
#: 1102446c31074fcba4e074cf54c1da73 17249eb0efee4e0db2dd192f99144e65
#: 1fde9aad62dd4fb39961f699daaa5027 3fd91d28514e436ba90cc5c778b2a7c1
#: 53e8f6ebe8b942dcbf310910de129fb5 b622013f4afa4cb9abfd6d1f56bde838
msgid ""
"Navigate to ``Model Setup`` menu, then select ``Protocol``.  Ensure that you"
" have ``Proto`` set to ``XJT``, and ``Type`` set to ``D16``."
msgstr ""
"导航到 ``Model Setup`` 菜单，然后选择 ``Protocol``。确保 ``Proto`` 设置为 ``XJT``，``Type`` "
"设置为 ``D16``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:164
#: 0d6c8baa99e8441ca9ddaedc2171282e 11101884c7ab4f43a4ea0e33c0dc3b74
#: 200d4007d7514b45af2a82f156da846c b5df2fa41d5a4a3fa518b76b4be60b42
#: cf39ebf6e42249d7a58bdeb7340b705d e8d3fe7baceb423f989b81a856be8c01
msgid "In older versions of the firmware, you may see `PXX` instead of `XJT`."
msgstr "在较旧版本的固件中，您可能看到 `PXX` 而不是 `XJT`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:167
#: 1bbde2781b30450bb63a08bfdbd4dafd 8b5e05af32064c7f816613f1343c1076
#: 8db0109826914d58a0c2f6536fa73fa4 bb6265191f694865a7145658c5c154c9
#: d6e68c6e6b1248a1aa5b94c2e248d7b4 d87fa0e2505c4f6f86bc86db64b75748
msgid ""
"Navigate to the ``Model Setup`` menu, then select ``Telemetry``, and then "
"again select ``Telemetry`` from the popup menu.  Ensure that ``UsrProto`` is"
" set to ``ArduP`` (for ArduPlane) or ``ArduC`` (for ArduCopter), ``Telemetry"
" Com Port`` (previously ``FrSky Com Port``) is ``1``, and ``Com Port "
"Invert`` (previously ``Invert Com 1``) is off (unchecked)."
msgstr ""
"导航到 ``Model Setup`` 菜单，然后选择 ``Telemetry``，再从弹出菜单中再次选择 ``Telemetry``。确保 "
"``UsrProto`` 设置为 ``ArduP`` （ArduPlane）或 ``ArduC`` （ArduCopter），``Telemetry "
"Com Port`` （以前称为 ``FrSky Com Port``）为 ``1``，``Com Port Invert`` （以前称为 "
"``Invert Com 1``）处于关闭（未勾选）状态。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:182
#: 1034f825c09a43ac8a9bbb39d59fee0a 4ccc9a5e419e4ea4bf88a6cf906bedad
#: 61f85622fab94db9993ac99293ea2951 9801bb4d07cd41438f9118ae3bb86f44
#: f141276baf9f4a7f905b3d8010f43ca6 f7857d017d18435d8559a2e9e44ca2d8
msgid ""
"If you are using something other than ArduPlane or ArduCopter, you can set "
"``UsrProto`` to ``FrSky``.  You will get a more basic telemetry display that"
" will be missing things like the graphic heading indicator, the name of the "
"current flight mode, and so forth."
msgstr ""
"如果使用的不是 ArduPlane 或 ArduCopter，可以将 ``UsrProto`` 设置为 "
"``FrSky``。您将获得更基础的数传显示，缺少图形航向指示器、当前飞行模式名称等内容。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:188
#: 04f730977aba4365b143f25ee29d380b 2cae3e8586634eb19e16663250c74131
#: 96cae15f8b2d44d3b21526ec2ec7d992 a2085819a41a41f0afb13d5eae33d708
#: b461fbf9d2924d67bc3ad9dc2fb6165d c5b4b28dfc7f4d28bf6e834381801de3
msgid ""
"At this point, you should be receiving extended telemetry on your 9XR Pro.  "
"If you navigate to the telemetry home screen (use the up/down arrows to "
"switch between screens) you should see standard FrSky telemetry values (such"
" as RSSI, receiver voltage, etc) as well as extended telemetry, such as "
"flight mode, current measurements, GPS information, etc."
msgstr ""
"此时，您应该能在 9XR Pro 上接收到扩展数传。导航到数传主屏幕（使用上/下箭头在屏幕间切换），应可看到标准 FrSky 数传值（如 "
"RSSI、接收机电压等）以及扩展数传，如飞行模式、电流测量、GPS 信息等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:199
#: 2121f27157be40ed866916f7490f4e2c 31aff7b9d3014ab0a6aa83bd0d7fd3fa
#: 4084bc4a7e12407aadcc15793cf9a9cd 89d09ee5bb434c4197c5230b7ff3b5eb
#: 9827752a6b4145d7a1c2993f498c4012 a32ed9cf903241a98162aa667683f34d
msgid "Use the left/right arrows to switch between available telemetry views:"
msgstr "使用左/右箭头在可用数传视图之间切换："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:206
#: 4fe1f372e1b8450d9e4285cd7a1f7217 88e9a96fbafb4e52a907829257e77ab6
#: 9cd5e23fb67b4719b069dc31920adce2 a908cb41d7ba43bfad3a8ee2150acceb
#: ae5c4096203d439fa13419729ccdaa3e d522ed7c8fcd42a5be72236f36f50678
msgid "Configuring custom telemetry screens"
msgstr "配置自定义数传屏幕"

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:208
#: 6aac553f47c04f0b9d544460c847d2f1 7b2998c34fc2414485c40c7348ffedce
#: 85c9d2ebf5c3423f84bfa6446fed138d 9082851a0b9f4174a5844c51bcd7ec1b
#: b331fd7731e34f33b73b6a3177543ee6 b5fa4460b2cd469a8b35d8a9237a2ff8
msgid ""
"ErSky9x allows you to customize two telemetry display screens with your "
"choice of information.  To configure the custom screens, navigate to ``Model"
" Setup``, then select ``Telemetry``, and then select ``Custom``:"
msgstr ""
"ErSky9x 允许您自定义两个数传显示屏幕，显示您选择的信息。要配置自定义屏幕，请导航到 ``Model Setup``，然后选择 "
"``Telemetry``，再选择 ``Custom``："

#: ../../source/docs/common-frsky-telemetry.rst:217
#: 3702366951a04de99b16205806e06bc7 67fa2699278945a2b812ce4f9d406e55
#: 89dff9da616f477aae4d119beb042eb3 9c1951c547804c5f9aec14cfd4fff721
#: e059e0af4c0d4524b98fbebcf66ca7b7 e0629026e1ad4aec8db2322839b8372e
